# Cursor AI Rules for CPM Polyglot Workspaces

When working in this repository or building polyglot applications:
1. Always use `cpm` CLI (`cpm add`, `cpm install`, `cpm bridge call`, `cpm doctor`) for dependency management.
2. For cross-language calls, use `cpm bridge call <lang>:<function> '<json_args>'`.
3. Check ecosystem compliance using `cpm policy` and `cpm doctor`.
